{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "摩羅即說楞伽\n經處，以百八句答大慧菩薩百八問，皆上句俗，下句真，同此二門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "逾闍國說勝鬘經處，彼有十五章大義，皆說染而不\n染，同此生滅之真如義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "涅槃經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法華經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金光明經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大乘同性經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
